{"product_id":"if-i-stay","title":"If I stay","description":"\u003cp\u003eNOW A MAJOR FILM STARRING CHLOE GRACE MORETZ 'Just listen,' Adam says with a voice that sounds like shrapnel.' I open my eyes wide now. I sit up as much as I can. And I listen. 'Stay,' he says. Everybody has to make choices. Some might break you. For seventeen-year-old Mia, surrounded by a wonderful family, friends and a gorgeous boyfriend decisions might seem tough, but they're all about a future full of music and love, a future that's brimming with hope. But life can change in an instant. A cold February morning . . . a snowy road . . . and suddenly all of Mia's choices are gone. Except one. As alone as she'll ever be, Mia must make the most difficult choice of all. Haunting, heartrending and ultimately life-affirming, If I Stay will make you appreciate all that you have, all that you've lost - and all that might be. Includes interviews with the stars of the film, Chloe Moretz and Jamie Blackley. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:129 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Gayle Forman \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781909531239 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761674330265,"sku":"5RC9781909531239","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/958c2addce6a19e4c51cd90b0c63db91.jpg?v=1720455136","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/if-i-stay","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}